  <spoon:CtClass name="BoilerConstants">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="The constants that characterise the boiler, its steam exit, its pumps and the control cycle.&#xA;The requirements name C, M1, M2, N1, N2, W, U1, U2 and P without giving values; the values here&#xA;are chosen to satisfy M1 &amp;lt; N1 &amp;lt; N2 &amp;lt; M2 &amp;lt; C and are integers so that the model needs&#xA;no rounding."/>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
